      "comment": "CAPPUCCINA (4) was below best last time but prior to that was narrowly beaten when fifth (23.77) in a Grade 4 at this track. Expecting significant improvement this line-up. ROCKY RACCOON (5) has missed the placings at his last couple but was in the money three back when third (24.48) at this track in a Grade 4. Has the ability and expected to do much better. MAILMAN'S COMING (7) was responsible for a modest effort most recently when fifth at this track over 407m behind Sunday Stroller (24.26) in a Grade 4/5. Was a winner the start prior. Safe beginner but wide box to overcome and will need some luck. Expected to feature in the finish. JACKPOT JUNIOR (2) is a last-start placegetter who is in the mix again.",
